      "field": "style",
      "category": "style",
      "variation": "core",
      "priority": "must",
      "zh": "以连贯的粗线概括{{silhouette}}，用较细的线交代{{structure}}。",
      "en": "Define {{silhouette}} with continuous broad outlines and describe {{structure}} with finer lines.",
      "evidence": [
        "E1"
      ],
      "when": null,
      "requires": [],
      "excludes": [],
      "check": "比较外轮廓与内部结构线的粗细。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "module": "E1",
      "field": "narrative",
      "category": "style",
      "variation": "core",
      "priority": "must",
      "zh": "让细节集中在{{focus}}，周围区域仅保留识别结构所需的线条。",
      "en": "Concentrate detail at {{focus}}; retain only structure-defining lines in the surrounding areas.",
      "evidence": [
        "E1"
      ],
      "when": null,
      "requires": [],
      "excludes": [],
      "check": "焦点附近信息密度最高。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "module": "C4",
      "field": "style",
      "category": "style",
      "variation": "core",
      "priority": "should",
      "zh": "纸底保持轻微颗粒，轮廓附近仅留零星干墨缺口。",
      "en": "Retain a subtle paper grain with sparse dry-ink breaks along contours.",
      "evidence": [
        "E1"
      ],
      "when": null,
      "requires": [],
      "excludes": [],
      "check": "观察纹理能否露出而不破坏形体。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "module": "B1",
      "field": "style",
      "category": "style",
      "variation": "core",
      "priority": "must",
      "zh": "色面以暖灰与米白为主。",
      "en": "Use warm grey and cream as the dominant color areas.",
      "evidence": [
        "E1"
      ],
      "when": null,
      "requires": [],
      "excludes": [],
      "check": "在大面积区域检查暖灰与米白。"
    },
    {
